# annotation-of with a triple-quoted doc string evaluates [unindent "..."] correctly (B-406).
# The doc value must be the unindented string content, not the expression "[unindent ...]".
[f: [fn@[return: String  doc: """
Gets the greeting.
"""] [let name@String] [str "Hello " name]]]
[ann: [annotation-of f]]
[result-doc: [= ann.doc "Gets the greeting."]
 result-ret: [= ann.return "String"]]
=== out
Dict({"result-doc": Bool(true), "result-ret": Bool(true)})
